---
import { profile, talks } from '../lib/content';
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="about-title">
      <p class="eyebrow section-label">04 / THE PERSON BEHIND THE WORK</p><h2
        id="about-title"
      >
        Builder first.<br /><em>Always curious.</em>
      </h2><span class="name-note"
        >Gyula Halmos <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span
      >
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <p class="about-lead">
        The interesting part starts<br />after the demo.
      </p><p>
        I’ve worked across cloud infrastructure, DevOps, connected homes, and AI
        agents. The common thread is automation that makes someone’s actual
        working day better.
      </p><p>
        Today, I’m an AI Ops Specialist at Polymarket. Previously, I helped
        build Craft Agents at Craft Docs. Through consulting and teaching, I
        bring that practical perspective to other teams.
      </p><p>
        I care about who owns the workflow, how it fails, and whether the people
        using it can make it their own.
      </p>
      <dl id="experience" class="experience">
        <div>
          <dt>NOW</dt><dd>
            <strong>Polymarket</strong><span>AI Ops Specialist</span><a
              href={profile.roleAnnouncement}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Read the public Polymarket role announcement (opens in a new tab)"
              ><Arrow /></a
            >
          </dd>
        </div><div>
          <dt>PREVIOUSLY</dt><dd>
            <strong>Craft Docs</strong><span
              >Building Craft Agents with the team</span
            >
          </dd>
        </div><div>
          <dt>FOUNDATIONS</dt><dd>
            <strong>Bosch · Yabune</strong><span
              >Cloud, DevOps & real-world automation</span
            >
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <a
        class="text-link"
        href={profile.linkedin}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >The longer story on LinkedIn <Arrow /><span class="sr-only">
          (opens in a new tab)</span
        ></a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="speaking" class="speaking wrap" aria-labelledby="speaking-title">
  <div class="speaking-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow section-label">05 / SHARING WHAT I LEARN</p><h2
      id="speaking-title"
    >
      Ideas, <em>out loud.</em>
    </h2><p>
      Honest conversations about building with technology.<br />Including the
      parts that didn’t go to plan.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="talk-list">
    {
      talks.map((talk) => (
        <a
          class="talk"
          href={talk.href}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <>
            <span class="talk-name">{talk.name}</span>
            <span class="talk-detail">
              <>
                <span class="eyebrow">{talk.tag}</span>
                <span>{talk.topic}</span>
              </>
            </span>
            <Arrow />
            <span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
          </>
        </a>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .about-section {
    background: #e9eade;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 7rem);
  }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }
  .about-title h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 4.8vw, 4.7rem);
  }
  .name-note {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    max-width: 100%;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font: italic 2.2rem var(--serif);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #b5b9a6;
    padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }
  .name-note > span {
    font: 1.5rem var(--font);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .about-content {
    padding-top: 2.6rem;
  }
  .about-lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.4vw, 2.1rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .about-content > p:not(.about-lead) {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #575f4d;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    max-width: 32rem;
  }
  .experience {
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .experience > div {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    padding-block: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #c6cab8;
  }
  .experience dt {
    font: 0.5rem/1.8 var(--mono);
    width: 5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: #626b55;
    padding-top: 0.1rem;
  }
  .experience dd {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .experience strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    grid-column: 1;
  }
  .experience dd > span {
    color: #626b55;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    grid-column: 1;
  }
  .experience a {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
    align-self: center;
  }
  .about-content > .text-link {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .speaking {
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 7.5vw, 7.5rem);
  }
  .speaking-heading {
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }
  .speaking-heading h2 {
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 4.8vw, 4.7rem);
  }
  .speaking-heading > p:last-child {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .talk {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.5fr 24px;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.9rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .talk:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .talk-name {
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }
  .talk-detail {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .talk-detail .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.52rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .talk-detail > span:last-child {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .talk:hover .talk-name {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.4rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .about-content {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
    .name-note {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    .about-lead {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
    }
    .experience > div {
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .experience dt {
      width: 4.3rem;
      font-size: 0.45rem;
    }
    .experience dd {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }
    .talk {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 24px;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding-block: 1.5rem;
    }
    .talk-name {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    .talk-detail {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 2;
    }
    .talk > svg {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 1;
    }
    .talk-detail > span:last-child {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
  }
</style>
